passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 43.6%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.91"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":73.71,"default_fair_val":73.71,"premium_pct":-38.3,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":16,"pe_forward":14.1,"pb_trailing":2.6,"pb_forward":2.3,"div_yield":5.77,"ps_ratio":3.8,"fcf_to_ev":3.43,"fcf_to_mcap":6.56,"liab_to_assets":43.6,"cash_to_assets":0.4,"current_ratio":0.91,"roe":15.9,"roa":8.5,"moat":{"ticker":"OHI","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"OHI 作為醫療保健房地產投資信託 (REIT)，其品牌和定價權相對有限。其收入主要來自租賃協議，租金水平受市場供需、租戶財務狀況及醫療保健行業整體趨勢影響。雖然其 REIT 結構使其能將部分利潤轉嫁給股東，但缺乏像消費品牌那樣的強大定價能力。租戶的支付能力是關鍵，這限制了其獨立提價的空間，尤其是在醫療保健支付體系面臨壓力的時期。","comment_en":"As a healthcare real estate investment trust (REIT), OHI's brand and pricing power are relatively limited. Its revenue primarily comes from lease agreements, with rental rates influenced by market supply and demand, tenant financial health, and overall healthcare industry trends. While its REIT structure allows for profit distribution to shareholders, it lacks the strong pricing power of consumer brands. Tenant solvency is crucial, limiting its ability to independently raise rents, especially during periods of pressure on healthcare payment systems."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"OHI 的護城河主要來自其在醫療保健房地產領域的特許經營權和監管壁壘。醫療保健設施的建設和運營受到嚴格的法規監管，進入門檻高。此外，其 REIT 結構在稅務上有優勢，這是一種監管紅利。其擁有的房地產組合，特別是專門的醫療保健設施，不易被競爭對手複製。然而，這類資產的價值也受醫療政策變動的影響，這是一個潛在的風險點。","comment_en":"OHI's moat primarily stems from its quasi-franchise and regulatory barriers within the healthcare real estate sector. The construction and operation of healthcare facilities are subject to stringent regulations, creating high entry barriers. Furthermore, its REIT structure offers tax advantages, which act as a regulatory benefit. The portfolio of properties it owns, particularly specialized healthcare facilities, is not easily replicated by competitors. However, the value of these assets is also susceptible to changes in healthcare policy, posing a potential risk."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"OHI 的轉換成本體現在其租戶（主要是運營商）更換醫療保健設施的難度上。搬遷專門的醫療設備、重新獲得許可證、以及重新建立患者群體和與支付方的關係，都構成了顯著的成本和時間障礙。這使得現有租戶傾向於與 OHI 續約，以避免這些高昂的轉換成本。然而，如果租戶經營不善，其轉換到其他設施的可能性依然存在。","comment_en":"OHI's switching costs are evident in the difficulty for its tenants (primarily operators) to change healthcare facilities. Relocating specialized medical equipment, re-obtaining licenses, and re-establishing patient bases and payer relationships represent significant cost and time hurdles. This incentivizes existing tenants to renew leases with OHI to avoid these substantial switching costs. However, if a tenant experiences operational difficulties, the possibility of them moving to other facilities remains."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"OHI 的業務模式（醫療保健房地產租賃）幾乎不存在網絡效應。其房地產資產的價值主要取決於其地理位置、設施質量和租戶的經營狀況，而非用戶之間的互動。與社交媒體或市場平台不同，OHI 的房地產並不會因為租戶數量的增加而變得更有價值。因此，網絡效應並非其護城河的組成部分。","comment_en":"OHI's business model of healthcare real estate leasing exhibits virtually no network effects. The value of its properties is primarily determined by location, facility quality, and tenant operational success, rather than user interactions. Unlike social media or marketplace platforms, OHI's real estate does not become more valuable as the number of tenants increases. Therefore, network effects do not constitute a component of its moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"OHI 作為一家大型 REIT，在獲取和管理醫療保健房地產方面具有規模經濟的優勢。其龐大的資產組合使其能夠獲得更優惠的融資條件，並在與供應商（如建築、維護服務）談判時擁有更大的議價能力。此外，其專業的運營和管理團隊能夠更有效地處理複雜的房地產投資組合，降低單位資產的管理成本。這種規模優勢有助於維持其盈利能力。","comment_en":"As a large REIT, OHI benefits from economies of scale in acquiring and managing healthcare real estate. Its substantial portfolio allows it to secure more favorable financing terms and provides greater bargaining power when negotiating with suppliers (e.g., construction, maintenance services). Furthermore, its specialized operational and management team can more efficiently handle a complex real estate portfolio, reducing per-asset management costs. This scale advantage helps sustain its profitability."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"OHI 的資產組合分散在美國各地，其中一些地理位置可能具有獨特性，尤其是在醫療服務需求高但供應相對不足的地區。然而，醫療保健房地產的價值很大程度上取決於其所在地區的醫療市場動態和人口結構，而非資產本身的絕對稀缺性。雖然某些特定地區的設施可能難以替代，但整體而言，其資產的獨特性並非其最主要的護城河。","comment_en":"OHI's portfolio is geographically diversified across the United States. Some locations may possess unique characteristics, especially in areas with high healthcare demand but relatively limited supply. However, the value of healthcare real estate largely depends on the local healthcare market dynamics and demographics rather than absolute scarcity of the asset itself. While certain facilities in specific regions might be difficult to substitute, overall, the uniqueness of its assets is not its primary moat."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"OHI 在運營效率方面表現穩健，主要體現在其對租戶的嚴格篩選和持續的租金收取能力。作為一家 REIT，其核心業務是管理和優化房地產資產組合，並確保穩定的現金流。通過專注於醫療保健領域，它積累了專業知識，能夠更好地評估租戶風險和管理資產。其 F-Score 為 8/9，顯示出良好的財務健康狀況和運營管理水平。","comment_en":"OHI demonstrates solid operational efficiency, primarily reflected in its rigorous tenant selection process and consistent ability to collect rent. As a REIT, its core business involves managing and optimizing its real estate portfolio and ensuring stable cash flows. By focusing on the healthcare sector, it has accumulated specialized knowledge, enabling better tenant risk assessment and asset management. Its F-Score of 8/9 indicates good financial health and operational management."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"OHI 在資本配置方面展現出較強的能力，尤其是在其 REIT 結構下，能夠有效地將租金收入轉化為股東回報。公司歷史上通過戰略性收購擴大了資產規模，並在維持穩定的股息支付方面表現出色。儘管其負債水平相對較高（$4,018.6M 負債對 $39.0M 現金），但其強勁的自由現金流（FCF TTM $903.3M）和穩定的租金收入支持了其資本配置策略，包括再投資和股息發放。","comment_en":"OHI exhibits strong capital allocation capabilities, particularly within its REIT structure, effectively converting rental income into shareholder returns. Historically, the company has strategically acquired assets to expand its portfolio and has performed well in maintaining stable dividend payments. Despite a relatively high debt level ($4,018.6M debt vs. $39.0M cash), its robust Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM $903.3M) and stable rental income support its capital allocation strategy, including reinvestment and dividend distribution."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"OHI 的客戶（租戶）留存率受到其租賃協議結構和租戶經營狀況的影響。如前所述，更換醫療保健設施的成本較高，這有助於提高租戶的留存率。然而，如果租戶面臨財務困境或經營失敗，OHI 可能會面臨租戶流失或需要尋找新的租戶，這會帶來不確定性。其 REIT 模式依賴於租戶的持續經營，因此客戶留存並非絕對保證。","comment_en":"OHI's customer (tenant) retention is influenced by the structure of its lease agreements and the operational health of its tenants. As mentioned, the high costs associated with relocating healthcare facilities contribute to tenant retention. However, if tenants face financial distress or operational failures, OHI may experience tenant turnover or the need to find new lessees, introducing uncertainty. Its REIT model relies on the continued operation of its tenants, thus customer retention is not an absolute guarantee."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"OHI 的業務具有一定的持久性，因為醫療保健服務是必需品，對經濟週期的敏感度相對較低。其 REIT 結構確保了穩定的租金收入流，這為公司提供了較強的抗風險能力。然而，其業務的長期持久性也受到醫療保健行業政策變化、支付模式演變以及利率波動的影響。儘管如此，對醫療保健設施的持續需求為其業務提供了堅實的基礎。","comment_en":"OHI's business possesses a degree of durability, as healthcare services are essential and relatively less sensitive to economic cycles. Its REIT structure ensures a stable stream of rental income, providing the company with considerable resilience against risks. However, the long-term durability of its business is also subject to changes in healthcare industry policies, evolving payment models, and interest rate fluctuations. Nonetheless, the ongoing demand for healthcare facilities provides a solid foundation for its operations."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"OHI 的護城河主要體現為一種受監管的特許經營權和規模經濟優勢。作為一家大型醫療保健房地產投資信託，其擁有的專業設施和地理位置分散的資產組合，加上 REIT 結構帶來的稅務優惠，構成了進入壁壘。租戶更換設施的高昂成本也提供了一定程度的客戶黏性。然而，其定價權受限於租戶的支付能力和醫療行業的宏觀壓力，且業務易受政策變動影響。總體而言，OHI 類似於一個擁有特定地理位置優勢的『收費橋』，其價值在於提供必需的基礎設施，但易受外部監管和租戶經營狀況的影響。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"OHI's moat is primarily characterized by a regulated quasi-franchise and economies of scale. As a large healthcare REIT, its portfolio of specialized facilities and geographically dispersed assets, coupled with tax advantages inherent in the REIT structure, creates entry barriers. High switching costs for tenants also provide a degree of customer stickiness. However, its pricing power is constrained by tenant solvency and broader healthcare industry pressures, and its business is susceptible to regulatory changes. Overall, OHI functions somewhat like a 'toll bridge' with specific location advantages, deriving value from providing essential infrastructure, but is subject to external regulatory shifts and tenant operational health.","evidenceHash":"9329f7d992c5bed08a1faef63d408bf7147b4a51108438b713cf4eaf6a4f5d37","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"a84b502dd5df6b837b41ac81c0954b92baed7e1ae5b14afb5e9e137c8d6adebe"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"a84b502dd5df6b837b41ac81c0954b92baed7e1ae5b14afb5e9e137c8d6adebe"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/OHI.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/OHI.png","website":"https://www.omegahealthcare.com","ceo":"Matthew Gourmand","full_time_employees":"69","description":"Omega Healthcare Investors, Inc. functions as a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT) primarily focused on the long-term healthcare sector. The company strategically invests in properties providing skilled nursing and assisted living services. A diverse array of healthcare operators manage these assets, predominantly utilizing a triple-net lease framework. Its portfolio is geographically distributed across all regions of the United States and also includes holdings in the United Kingdom.","description_en":"Omega Healthcare Investors, Inc. functions as a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT) primarily focused on the long-term healthcare sector. The company strategically invests in properties providing skilled nursing and assisted living services. A diverse array of healthcare operators manage these assets, predominantly utilizing a triple-net lease framework. Its portfolio is geographically distributed across all regions of the United States and also includes holdings in the United Kingdom.","description_zh":"**Omega Healthcare Investors, Inc. (OHI) 業務營運精煉**\n\nOmega Healthcare Investors, Inc. (OHI) 是一家專注於長期照護產業的房地產投資信託基金 (REIT)。公司策略性地投資於提供技術護理 (skilled nursing) 及輔助生活 (assisted living) 服務的房地產。\n\nOHI 的核心業務模式為持有並出租這些醫療照護資產給多元化的第三方醫療照護營運商。這些營運商主要採用「淨三租」 (triple-net lease) 的租賃架構，意即租戶負責支付租金、物業稅、保險及維護費用。此營運模式有助於 OHI 產生穩定的租金收入，並將營運風險轉嫁給租戶。\n\nOHI 的投資組合遍及美國全境各區域，並包含部分英國的資產。透過多元化的地理分佈及與眾多營運商的合作，OHI 旨在分散風險並維持其長期穩健的收益。","address":"303 International Circle","city":"Hunt Valley","state":"MD","zip":"21030","country":"US","phone":"410-427-1700","full_address":"303 International Circle, Hunt Valley, MD 21030, US","range_52w":"39.26-52.39","year_high":52.39,"year_low":39.26,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":39.26,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Golem Lucas M.","title":"officer: CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":1050,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Golem Lucas M.","title":"officer: CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":2776,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Golem Lucas M.","title":"officer: CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":2776,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Golem Lucas M.","title":"officer: CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":1050,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Golem Lucas M.","title":"officer: CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":64,"price":39.37,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Golem Lucas M.","title":"officer: CHIEF ACCOUNTING OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"D-Return","shares":3,"price":46.31,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"PICKETT C TAYLOR","title":"director, officer: CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":26177,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"PICKETT C TAYLOR","title":"director, officer: CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":69225,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"PICKETT C TAYLOR","title":"director, officer: CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":69225,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-30","name":"PICKETT C TAYLOR","title":"director, officer: CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":26177,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[],"fmp_symbol":"OHI","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series"